{"seq":2,"slug":"navigation-positioning","title":"导航与定位技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/intelligent-control-navigation/navigation-positioning","wordCount":1654,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"导航与定位技术\">导航与定位技术</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>城市低空飞行器的导航精度需求远超传统航空——在建筑密集区执行物流配送或巡检任务时，水平定位精度须达到分米级甚至厘米级，而高度精度需优于 1 m。这一苛刻要求催生了多源融合导航体系：从卫星定位到惯性导航，从视觉里程计到激光 SLAM，低空导航正走向&quot;无单一失效点&quot;的全冗余架构。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-gnss-卫星导航基础\">1 GNSS 卫星导航基础</h3><p>全球导航卫星系统（GNSS）是低空飞行器最基础的定位手段。当前可用星座：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>国家/区域</th>\n<th>卫星数</th>\n<th>频段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GPS</td>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>31</td>\n<td>L1/L2/L5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BDS-3</td>\n<td>中国</td>\n<td>30+</td>\n<td>B1I/B1C/B2a/B3I</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Galileo</td>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>28</td>\n<td>E1/E5a/E5b</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GLONASS</td>\n<td>俄罗斯</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>G1/G2/G3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>单点定位（SPP）精度约 2–5 m（水平）。对低空飞行器，这远远不够。</p>\n<p><strong>RTK（实时动态载波相位差分）</strong> 通过基站-移动站双差观测消除公共误差，实现厘米级定位：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\nabla\\phi = \\Delta\\nabla\\rho + \\lambda \\Delta\\nabla N + \\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\nabla</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ∇</span></span></span></span></span> 表示双差算子，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 为载波波长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为整周模糊度。模糊度固定（AR）是 RTK 的核心难点，LAMBDA 算法是当前最高效的搜索方法。</p>\n<p><strong>PPP-RTK</strong>：结合精密单点定位（PPP）与 RTK 的优势，通过状态空间表示（SSR）播发精密改正数，实现无基站厘米级定位，收敛时间压缩至秒级。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-惯性导航系统-ins\">2 惯性导航系统（INS）</h3><p>惯性导航通过积分加速度计和陀螺仪输出获得位置/速度/姿态，其核心优势是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>完全自主，不依赖外部信号</li>\n<li>输出频率高（100–1000 Hz）</li>\n<li>短时精度高</li>\n</ul>\n<p>但 INS 的致命缺陷是误差随时间漂移。导航级 IMU 的位置误差增长率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msub><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta p(t) \\approx \\frac{1}{2} b_a t^2 + \\frac{1}{6} \\dot{b}_a t^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为加速度计零偏。MEMS 级 IMU（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_a \\sim 0.1 \\, \\text{mg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg</span></span></span></span></span></span>）在 10 s 内漂移约 0.5 m，60 s 内漂移约 18 m——因此 INS 必须与外部观测融合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-gnss-ins-组合导航\">3 GNSS/INS 组合导航</h3><p>GNSS/INS 互补融合是低空导航的黄金标准：GNSS 提供长期稳定的绝对位置，INS 提供高频短期精确姿态和速度。融合架构：</p>\n<p><strong>松耦合</strong>：GNSS 输出位置/速度作为观测量输入 EKF：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{z}_k = \\begin{bmatrix} \\mathbf{p}_{INS} - \\mathbf{p}_{GNSS} \\\\ \\mathbf{v}_{INS} - \\mathbf{v}_{GNSS} \\end{bmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GN</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GN</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>紧耦合</strong>：直接使用 GNSS 伪距/多普勒原始观测量，在卫星可见数不足 4 颗时仍可约束 INS 漂移。</p>\n<p><strong>深耦合/超紧耦合</strong>：INS 辅助 GNSS 接收机载波跟踪环路，提升信号跟踪动态性能。</p>\n<p>状态向量通常包含 15–21 维：位置、速度、姿态、陀螺零偏、加速度计零偏（各 3 轴）。误差状态卡尔曼滤波器（ESKF）是工程首选。</p>\n<h3 id=\"4-视觉导航与-slam\">4 视觉导航与 SLAM</h3><p>在 GNSS 拒止环境（室内、地下、高楼遮挡）中，视觉导航成为关键替代：</p>\n<p><strong>视觉里程计（VO）</strong>：通过连续帧间特征匹配估计相对运动。单目 VO 存在尺度模糊，需与 IMU 融合（VIO）。代表算法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>VINS-Mono / VINS-Fusion（紧耦合预积分 VIO）</li>\n<li>ORB-SLAM3（特征法 SLAM，支持多地图）</li>\n<li>MSCKF（多状态约束卡尔曼滤波）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>视觉惯性里程计（VIO）</strong> 的核心是 IMU 预积分理论：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mtext>Exp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">ω</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\mathbf{R}_{ij} = \\prod_{k=i}^{j-1} \\text{Exp}((\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{\\omega}}_k - \\mathbf{b}_g)\\Delta t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9722em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1609em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8588em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3471em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Exp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.037em;\">ω</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>预积分量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\mathbf{R}_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9722em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\mathbf{v}_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\mathbf{p}_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在零偏变化时可通过一阶近似快速更新，避免重新积分。</p>\n<p><strong>激光 SLAM</strong>：3D LiDAR（如 Livox Mid-360）提供稠密点云，配合 LOAM/FAST-LIO 算法实现厘米级建图与定位。优势是不受光照影响，劣势是重量和功耗较大。</p>\n<h3 id=\"5-多源融合导航框架\">5 多源融合导航框架</h3><p>实际低空飞行器采用多源融合策略，典型传感器组合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"RTK-GNSS + MEMS-IMU + 双目相机 + 激光雷达 + 气压计 + 磁力计 + UWB\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>RTK-GNSS + MEMS-IMU + 双目相机 + 激光雷达 + 气压计 + 磁力计 + UWB</span></span></code></pre></div><p>融合框架设计要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>异步多速率融合</strong>：各传感器频率不同（GNSS 10 Hz, IMU 200 Hz, 相机 30 Hz），需异步 EKF 或因子图优化</li>\n<li><strong>退化检测与切换</strong>：GNSS 信号质量下降时自动切换到 VIO 主导模式</li>\n<li><strong>完好性监测</strong>：RAIM（接收机自主完好性监测）用于检测 GNSS 故障卫星</li>\n<li><strong>因子图优化</strong>：iSAM2 / GTSAM 框架支持增量式后端优化，适合计算受限平台</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-拒止环境导航\">6 拒止环境导航</h3><p>城市峡谷、隧道、室内等 GNSS 完全不可用场景的导航方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>UWB 定位</strong>：部署锚节点网络，TWR/TDoA 模式实现 10–30 cm 定位精度</li>\n<li><strong>5G 定位</strong>：利用毫米波大带宽实现高精度到达时间估计</li>\n<li><strong>地磁导航</strong>：利用建筑物内部磁场指纹匹配</li>\n<li><strong>地形匹配导航（TERCOM）</strong>：将下视传感器观测与先验地形数据库匹配</li>\n<li><strong>协同定位</strong>：多机相对测距（UWB/视觉）构建相对坐标系</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2025年，基于神经辐射场（NeRF）和 3D 高斯泼溅（3DGS）的地图表示正在革新视觉定位方式——飞行器可在预建的隐式地图中通过渲染-比对实现高精度重定位。国内千寻位置、六分科技等企业推动 PPP-RTK 服务覆盖全国，收敛时间压缩到 3–5 秒。北斗三号短报文与精密定位融合（BDSBAS）为低空飞行器提供了独立于地面网络的应急导航能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>推导 MEMS IMU（加速度计零偏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_a = 0.5 \\, \\text{mg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg</span></span></span></span></span></span>）在纯惯性导航模式下，30 s 后的水平位置漂移量。</li>\n<li>设计一个 15 状态 ESKF 的状态向量和观测方程，说明 GNSS 位置观测如何约束 INS 漂移。</li>\n<li>比较松耦合与紧耦合 GNSS/INS 架构在&quot;仅 3 颗卫星可见&quot;场景下的定位能力差异。</li>\n<li>VIO 系统中，IMU 预积分相比直接积分的计算优势是什么？在零偏在线估计更新时如何高效重用预积分量？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>低空导航定位是一个&quot;没有银弹&quot;的系统工程——任何单一传感器都有其盲区。GNSS/INS 组合提供基础定位能力，RTK/PPP-RTK 提升至厘米级，视觉/激光 SLAM 填补拒止环境空白，UWB/5G 覆盖室内场景。工程师的核心能力在于：理解每种传感器的误差模型，设计合理的融合架构，并在退化场景中保证系统完好性。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"导航与定位技术","id":"导航与定位技术"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"1 GNSS 卫星导航基础","id":"1-gnss-卫星导航基础"},{"level":3,"text":"2 惯性导航系统（INS）","id":"2-惯性导航系统-ins"},{"level":3,"text":"3 GNSS/INS 组合导航","id":"3-gnss-ins-组合导航"},{"level":3,"text":"4 视觉导航与 SLAM","id":"4-视觉导航与-slam"},{"level":3,"text":"5 多源融合导航框架","id":"5-多源融合导航框架"},{"level":3,"text":"6 拒止环境导航","id":"6-拒止环境导航"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"飞行控制系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/intelligent-control-navigation/flight-control-systems"},"next":{"title":"多机协同与集群智能","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/intelligent-control-navigation/multi-uav-collaboration"}}